# PyBeam QA's direct dependencies. requirements.txt is compiled from this file and pins every package exactly;
# install from requirements.txt, not from here. See docs/results-stability.md section 5.
#
# pylinac and PySide6 are pinned here too, because they are a contract rather than a convenience:
# - pylinac: every reported number comes from it, and its results move between versions. Upgrade it on purpose, with
#   the drift report (tests/gui/README.md, "Baselines and pylinac upgrades").
# - PySide6: ui/py_ui/*_ui.py are generated by pyside6-uic 6.7.0; ui/convertUI.sh must run under the same version.
#
# To change a version: edit this file, then recompile with uv (https://docs.astral.sh/uv/):
#   uv pip compile requirements.in --universal --python-version 3.12 -o requirements.txt
pylinac==3.49.0
PySide6==6.7.0
